      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed agents reporting setup problems that were not there. Connection discovery no longer drops a connector the runtime already reported, an agent's own configured server is read instead of a catalog entry sharing its name, and a file check the operating system refuses is reported as unchecked rather than missing.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
